THE MODIFICATION (2026-10-21, part 2) — skip the panel first-run onboarding
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changed: App\Actions\Platform\ProvisionWorkspace (and EnsureWorkspaceOwner) set
the workspace's `onboarding_step` to null — upstream's own "onboarding complete"
marker (App\Filament\Pages\SetupWorkspace) — for a PLATFORM-provisioned tenant.

Reason: upstream's panel drops a brand-new workspace into its first-run
onboarding wizard. A platform tenant has already described itself at signup
(name, domain, plan), so making the brand re-enter that in the CRM is the same
"register again" friction the session broker exists to remove (t_5df176cd).

Files modified:
  app/Actions/Platform/ProvisionWorkspace.php    clears onboarding_step after create
  app/Actions/Platform/EnsureWorkspaceOwner.php  clears it when adopting a workspace

NO UPSTREAM LOGIC WAS ALTERED. The wizard itself is untouched and still runs for
workspaces created through upstream's own registration UI.
